  <h1>This site isn't active right now</h1>
  <p>The website normally hosted at this address is temporarily unavailable.</p>
  <p>If you're the site owner, sign in to your <a href="${app_url}">Cinderblock dashboard</a> to check its status.</p>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <span class="badge">Cinderblock</span>
</main>
